    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t009r0101_researcher_01",
      "hash": "6c99d42dae79fe51",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我们每天都在这里\\n研究宝可梦。\\c\\n除此之外，也有客人\\n把罕见的宝可梦\\r\\n送到这里来。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t009r0101_researcher_02",
      "hash": "6c99d12dae79f938",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你是来参观的吗？\\n佩服，佩服！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t009r0101_researcher_03",
      "hash": "6c99d22dae79faeb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀～！\\n在走廊里不要乱跑！\\c\\n……我啊，\\n好想这么说说看呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t009r0101_picture_01",
      "hash": "d27a50d1b0482927",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是红莲研究所创始人\\n富士博士的照片！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t009r0101_kanban_01",
      "hash": "f31ef3f980dacb0e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "红莲研究所　会客室"
